{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "ef569fc637df490e",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 0: The Grand Strategy",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "3320ab678cd94de3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Decision Tree\n>\n> 1. **Check First:** Limit $\\ne 0$? -> **DIV**.\n> 2. **Check Form:** Geometric? P-Series?\n> 3. **Compare:** Similar to simple form? -> **LCT/DCT**.\n> 4. **Signs:** Alternating? -> **AST/Leibniz**.\n> 5. **Algebra:** Factors/Products? -> **Ratio**. Powers? -> **Root**.\n> 6. **Stuck?** Ratio=1? -> **Raabe's/Log**.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "1dc2e1b7e2364bce",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/93kWkB4K/b2297e937d77.jpg",
            "x": -250,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        },
        {
            "id": "56d2618f3c7044e1",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 1: Sequences",
            "x": 700,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "a453e0b353b14e27",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> What is a Sequence?\n>\n> An **ordered list** of numbers: $a_n$.\n>\n> **Convergence:**\n> * Value settles at $L$.\n> * Example: $1/n \\to 0$.\n>\n> **Divergence:**\n> 1. **Unbounded:** goes to $\\infty$. ($n^2$)\n> 2. **Oscillating:** jumps forever. ($(-1)^n$)\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 700,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "4"
        },
        {
            "id": "2ce76baa96264389",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/Xr1NysSk/66f23dc2ea8f.jpg",
            "x": 800,
            "y": -250,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        },
        {
            "id": "c22786bfc6694a03",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 2: The Transition",
            "x": 1400,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "ae80777cef7b49ce",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> List vs. Sum\n>\n> | Feature | Sequence $\\{a_n\\}$ | Series $\\sum a_n$ |\n> | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n> | **Concept** | A **List** | A **Total** |\n> | **Op** | Commas | Plus Signs |\n> | **Goal** | Where terms go | Where total goes |\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-blue\n    ",
            "x": 1400,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "1a367d75d6514040",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> The 'Cup Filling' Analogy\n>\n> How can infinite additions be finite?\n>\n> * Imagine filling a cup.\n> * Add 1/2, then 1/4, then 1/8...\n> * You pour forever, but you **never overflow**.\n> * The **Limit** is the full cup.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 1400,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "caad99bf4b0b460b",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/7dZvPSrL/2228890267d2.jpg",
            "x": 1550,
            "y": 250,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        },
        {
            "id": "7ad96e56114340a0",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 3: The Gatekeeper",
            "x": 2100,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "ec5c932a132c4d3a",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> n-th Term Test\n>\n> Check the **Limit of Sequence** ($a_n$).\n>\n> * If $\\lim a_n \\neq 0$: The Total **Diverges**.\n> * If $\\lim a_n = 0$: **INCONCLUSIVE**.\n>\n> > [!warning] Terms going to 0 $\\neq$ Convergence!\n> > (See Harmonic Series)\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-red\n    ",
            "x": 2100,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "1"
        },
        {
            "id": "5e4f9ad2e66e46e9",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/xKMcGyGF/7c13418d954b.jpg",
            "x": 2450,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 150,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "ee1842cb682e4242",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 4: Known Forms",
            "x": 2800,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "fba55a4dbc5c408a",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Geometric Series\n> $\\sum ar^n$\n>\n> * **Converges:** $|r| < 1$\n>   * $Sum = \\frac{a}{1-r}$\n> * **Diverges:** $|r| \\ge 1$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-blue\n    ",
            "x": 2800,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "1e5ebea95e2a49ab",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> P-Series\n> $\\sum \\frac{1}{n^p}$\n>\n> * **Converges:** $p > 1$\n> * **Diverges:** $p \\le 1$\n>\n> > [!tip] Harmonic ($p=1$) Diverges.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-blue\n    ",
            "x": 2800,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "4032cd506330484b",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 5: Compare",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "14e03ba35e6c4c84",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Direct Comparison (DCT)\n>\n> * Smaller than Convergent? **Conv.**\n> * Bigger than Divergent? **Div.**\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "1810cf9c2aff4d29",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Limit Comparison (LCT)\n>\n> $L = \\lim \\frac{a_n}{b_n}$\n>\n> * $0 < L < \\infty$: **Behave Identically**.\n> * Use when terms look \"messy\" but resemble P-Series.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "8c0ca920c0c44389",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Integral Test\n>\n> If $f(x)$ is continuous, positive, **decreasing**:\n>\n> $\\sum a_n$ behaves like $\\int_{1}^{\\infty} f(x) dx$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": 800,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "3b179a25dcd4410c",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 6: Advanced Tools",
            "x": 4200,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "e81d765b291b4574",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Ratio Test\n> Best for $n!$ / $c^n$.\n>\n> $L = \\lim |\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}|$\n> * $L < 1$: Conv.\n> * $L > 1$: Div.\n> * $L = 1$: **FAIL** (Raabe needed).\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 4200,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "e8eb2936ff534fbc",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Root Test\n> Best for exponents $(...)^n$.\n>\n> $L = \\lim \\sqrt[n]{|a_n|}$\n> * $L < 1$: Conv.\n> * $L > 1$: Div.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 4200,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "c2be4ebb444845a2",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Gold Standard: Leibniz\n> (Alternating Series Test)\n>\n> $\\sum (-1)^n b_n$ Converges if:\n> 1. Terms decrease ($b_{n+1} \\le b_n$)\n> 2. Limit is 0 ($\\lim b_n = 0$)\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-green\n    ",
            "x": 4200,
            "y": 800,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "2076f207f2ba4d77",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/cXcWcFJ3/f11ab2a004bd.jpg",
            "x": 4550,
            "y": -50,
            "width": 150,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "93558ca8e7144526",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 7: The Last Resort",
            "x": 4900,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "f73b4c8aeca84b4a",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Raabe's Test\n> Use when **Ratio Test = 1**.\n>\n> $L = \\lim n(1 - |\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}|)$\n>\n> * $L > 1$: Conv. (Big $L$ is good)\n> * $L < 1$: Div.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 4900,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "bdf8743c61da4377",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Logarithmic Test\n> Use when Raabe is messy.\n>\n> $L = \\lim \\frac{\\ln(1/|a_n|)}{\\ln n}$\n>\n> * $L > 1$: Conv.\n> * $L < 1$: Div.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 4900,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "4595b41b51184fe3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 8: Power Series",
            "x": 5600,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "7bc34012f45048b2",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Power Series\n>\n> $\\sum c_n (x-a)^n$\n>\n> * Finds **Radius of Convergence** ($R$).\n> * \"Where is the function valid?\"\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 5600,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "4281786a9d144a90",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Taylor Series\n>\n> $f(x) = \\sum \\frac{f^{(n)}(a)}{n!} (x-a)^n$\n>\n> * $e^x = 1 + x + x^2/2! + ...$\n> * $\\sin x = x - x^3/3! + ...$\n> * $\\cos x = 1 - x^2/2! + ...$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 5600,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "b7510a76f1b842d4",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Why this matters?",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": 1200,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "43580432c9124f7f",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Engineering Applications\n>\n> 1. **Fourier Series:** Breaking waves into frequencies.\n> 2. **Z-Transform:** Digital Control Systems.\n> 3. **Taylor Approx:** Physics ($\\sin x \\approx x$).\n> 4. **Finance:** Compound Interest ($e^x$).\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 3500,
            "y": 1300,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "10a4db82a8864108",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "https://i.ibb.co/bR88tKW3/1a70917951b7.jpg",
            "x": 3350,
            "y": 1300,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        }
    ],
